<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK TURNS TO LOSS IN JULY.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK TURNS TO LOSS IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.82 vs   0.06 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.82 vs   0.06 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.43 vs   0.33 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    3.42 vs   4.74</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.45 vs   0.4  loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.45 vs   1.90 loss</p>
<p> Operating loss	 3.60 vs   0.86</p>
<p> Sales		   23.52 vs  24.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Prochnik SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
